.DS_Store
.claude/settings.local.json
# `var/*`, not `var/`: git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is
# excluded, so the two negations below would silently do nothing.
var/*
# Two exceptions, and they are the same exception twice: neither of these can be
# regenerated from the repository. `golden-set.json` is human judgement, and the
# only copy of it that survives `docker compose down -v`. `baseline.json` is the
# measurement every later Phase 2 milestone reports its diff against — a
# baseline that lives only on one machine is not a baseline.
!var/golden-set.json
!var/baseline.json
# The hybrid baseline sits *alongside* the vector one rather than replacing it.
# Two systems now exist, the vector number is what M2.0 recorded Phase 2 starting
# from, and overwriting it would lose the only fixed point later milestones have.
!var/baseline-hybrid.json
# Questions the corpus cannot answer. Hand-written, not regenerable, and the
# guardrail's test set — losing it would remove the only check on fabrication.
!var/refusal-queries.json
# M3.5's control. The committed hybrid baseline predates M2.4's reranking, so a
# comparison against it mixes two changes; this is the same code and corpus with
# graph expansion switched off, which is the only thing an M3.5 delta can honestly
# be measured against. Committed for the reason the others are: a baseline that
# lives on one machine is not a baseline.
!var/baseline-graph-off.json

# Web
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
